# WeCoop App

Repo: `AynixTech/wecoop-app`. Flutter/Dart, bundle `org.wecoop.app` (`pubspec.yaml` version `1.5.5+26`).

- API: backend Node via `lib/config/api_config.dart` (default prod `https://wecoop-backend-s9gl.onrender.com/api`).
- State: `provider` (`LocaleProvider`, `FirmaDigitaleProvider`).
- Native: Firebase Messaging, Stripe, `app_links`, `flutter_secure_storage`.

`lib/services/wordpress_service.dart` chiama il backend Node (`ApiConfig.baseUrl`), non WordPress REST.
